  "description": "The Gardens Point Parser Generator (GPPG) for .NET 10, with MSBuild integration. Generated parsers put each semantic action in a method of its own, which makes a parse up to about 10 times faster for a large grammar. Adds the %nolocations declaration and reads UTF-8 grammar files. Uses the same YaccFile items as YaccLexTools.Gppg, and adds the parser runtime to the build.",
